---
import Layout from '@/layouts/layout.astro'
import { careers } from '@/content/careers'
import { hobbies } from '@/content/hobbies'

const rowClass =
  'border-t border-line-soft py-6 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0 last:pb-0'
const headingClass =
  'text-[17px] leading-[1.65] font-[650] tracking-[-0.005em] text-ink'
const textClass = 'mb-2 text-[15px] leading-[1.85] tracking-[0.03em] last:mb-0'
---

<Layout title="About" ogpPath="about">
  <h1 class="page-title">About Me</h1>

  <section
    class="card space-y-2 text-[15px] leading-[1.9] tracking-[0.04em] sm:text-base"
  >
    <p>常見健太。ハンドルネームはtocomi。</p>
    <p>
      実際は本名の「つねみ」で呼ばれることが多いので、自己紹介でいつも迷ってます。
    </p>
    <p>栃木県出身の1992年生まれ。</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="section-title">経歴</h2>
    <div class="card">
      {
        careers.map(career => (
          <div class={rowClass}>
            <p class="mb-1 text-sm leading-[1.7] text-muted tabular-nums">
              {career.period}
            </p>
            <h3 class={headingClass}>{career.company}</h3>
            <p class="mb-2.5 text-sm leading-[1.7] text-muted">{career.role}</p>
            {career.description.map(line => (
              <p class={textClass}>{line}</p>
            ))}
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="section-title">趣味</h2>
    <div class="card">
      {
        hobbies.map(hobby => (
          <div class={rowClass}>
            <h3 class:list={[headingClass, 'mb-1.5']}>
              {hobby.icon} {hobby.title}
            </h3>
            {[hobby.description].flat().map(line => (
              <p class={textClass}>{line}</p>
            ))}
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
